        "children": [],
        "answer": {
          "short": "$7.4\\text{ cm}$",
          "worked": "Let $s$ be the side length in centimetres.\n$$\\begin{align*}s^3&=400\\\\s&=\\sqrt[3]{400}\\\\s&\\approx7.4.\\end{align*}$$\nThe side length is $7.4\\text{ cm}$, correct to one decimal place.",
